  "prompt": "Your alarm screams at seven in the morning. You drag yourself out of bed for another shift, and tonight you'll collapse just to repeat it all again. Now rewind fifty thousand years into the Stone Age. Your only tool is a sharpened wooden spear, and you wake up beside a small fire on open dirt. We were taught ancient life was a grim, nonstop struggle, at least according to every textbook we read in school.",
